WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.800
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.260
The one, the only, Kurt Sloane!

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.900
Welcome back.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.360
It is time for you to defend your title.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.000
In another fight to the death.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.000
Or you'll spend the rest of your life in prison.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.840
Meet Mongkut.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.860
Superior human specimen.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:34.860
Bigger...

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.760
Stronger than any human being on the planet.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.520
Never again.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.560
We have to find a way to match this up.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.940
They kidnapped your wife.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.680
You have to start to train.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.360
The strongest man doesn't always win.

00:00:59.835 --> 00:01:02.135
But the smartest one does.

00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:07.365
Your strengths against his weakness.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.920
What's his weakness?
- That's a good question.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.540
Just sit back

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.680
and enjoy the ride.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.040
Bring it.

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:41.960
You interrupted my meditation.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.760
Really? Does that help you stay calm?

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.200
I guess not.

